## Version: 3.8.3
## Author: rusty
## SavedVariables: SpokenPlacesSettings, SpokenZonesSettings
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: SpokenPlacesCharacter, SpokenZonesCharacter
## LoadSavedVariablesFirst: true
# ^ load-bearing beyond convenience: the generated data files under Data/ ask
# Language.lua which language to build a table for, and it can only answer that
# early because SpokenPlacesSettings is already populated. Without this line every player
# silently reads English.
## Dependencies: Spoken
# Spoken is what this module runs on, and ships in the same zip.
## OptionalDeps: SpokenPlacesAudio, ZoneLoreAudio, ZoneLoreAudio64
# The packs are not a registration mechanism: they register themselves into
# SpokenPlacesAudioPacks and Audio.lua walks that on demand, so this list is load order only.
#
# Both pack folder names are listed: SpokenPlacesAudio is what ships now, ZoneLoreAudio
# what a player installed before the rename, and ZoneLoreAudio64 the retired smaller
# tier. A name here that nobody has installed costs nothing.
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\Spoken_Places\Textures\AddonIcon.tga
## Group: Spoken
## X-License: Addon code MIT. Zone lore text from warcraft.wiki.gg, CC BY-SA 4.0.
## X-Credits: Lore text sourced from warcraft.wiki.gg contributors (CC BY-SA 4.0).


